# Map V3 orbit trails

Before changing orbit trail rendering or planet/moon orbit builders:

1. Read **`docs/ORBIT_TRAIL_DRAWING_GUIDE.md`** — **§2 Motion tail**; **§12** to change DLL sample count (128) or web densify (512); samples-first geometry in `densifyPlanetOrbitTrail.ts`.
2. Prefer **`opacityForOrbitTailAhead`** / **`closedRingHalfGradientOpacities`** for closed rings; do not reintroduce full-ring symmetric opacity (`trailVertexOpacitiesKspRing`) or analytic-first planet paths when ≥2 telemetry samples exist.
3. Default new solar-map features to **Map V3** (`3d-v3`, `web/src/scene/v3/`, `web/src/map-v3/`). Keep v1/v2 changes minimal (regression only).
4. DLL sample changes require **`scripts/build.ps1`** + **`scripts/install.ps1`**; bump `KSP_WEB_MAP_UI_VERSION` and `index.html` `?v=`.
5. Update **`docs/MAP_V3_RENDERING_GUIDE.md`**, **`MAP_V3_PLANET_ORBIT_SPEC.md`**, and run **`npm test`** when behavior changes.
6. Orbit **colors** / Customize Map / mod packs: **`docs/PLANET_ORBIT_COLOR_GUIDE.md`**.

Program state: **`docs/MAP_V3_PROGRAM_STATE.md`**.
